Author: Marcus Schack Abildskov <work@marcus-sa.dev>
Date:   Sun Nov 22 16:44:20 2026 +0100

    feat(node-local-persistent-volume): report a busy volume disk at VMM start as a held volume
    
    The forked Cloud Hypervisor exits 111 when the volume disk's exclusive
    open returns EBUSY (ADR-0319). A launch that attached a volume and whose
    VMM ends with that status fails as VolumeUnavailable { Held }, charged
    like a claim still held after the wait. Mapped from the typed exit
    status only, never stderr.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Step-Id: 04-03
    Task-Id: node-local-persistent-volume

